  "statement": "Find the number of ordered triples of integers \\((a, b, c)\\) with \\(1 \\leq a, b, c \\leq 100\\) and \\(a^{2} b+b^{2} c+c^{2} a=\\) \\(a b^{2}+b c^{2}+c a^{2}\\).",
