      "id": "sol.hmmt-nov-guts-2013-p30.hmmt",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "29800 This factors as \\((a-b)(b-c)(c-a)=0\\). By the inclusion-exclusion principle, we get \\(3 \\cdot 100^{2}-3 \\cdot 100+100=29800\\).",
